<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-047-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.26625" lon="-120.919072"><name>SC26-047-A</name><cmt>SC26-047</cmt><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 11.9 m relief across 210 m. Terrain A 83/100; not catch probability. Center 131 ft; nearby 123–154 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-030</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.26937513584391" lon="-120.91992615994243"/><trkpt lat="35.269119918562716" lon="-120.92081207771916"/><trkpt lat="35.268676919290066" lon="-120.9212630944481"/><trkpt lat="35.268682584535334" lon="-120.92159271973277"/><trkpt lat="35.26841791608057" lon="-120.92192925123713"/><trkpt lat="35.268316475700345" lon="-120.92127230551398"/><trkpt lat="35.26804236575159" lon="-120.92105946526843"/><trkpt lat="35.267591811271714" lon="-120.92107097993251"/><trkpt lat="35.26759558845004" lon="-120.92129072715518"/><trkpt lat="35.266962923533065" lon="-120.92119697278869"/><trkpt lat="35.26687658949481" lon="-120.92141902079699"/><trkpt lat="35.26633781213896" lon="-120.92154270731511"/><trkpt lat="35.26625902857555" lon="-120.92220424068967"/><trkpt lat="35.26608069413947" lon="-120.92231871539038"/><trkpt lat="35.264821027